{"schemaVersion":1,"corpusId":"euclid-elements-heath-1908","status":"raw_machine","contentItem":{"id":"euclid-6-6","kind":"proposition","title":"两边成比例且夹角相等的三角形相似","englishTitle":"If two triangles have one angle equal to one angle and the sides about the equal angles proportional, the triangles will be equiangular and will have those angles equal which the corresponding sides subtend.","book":6,"number":6,"status":"raw_machine","sourceMissing":false,"source":{"urn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:6.prop.6","url":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:6.prop.6/","group":"prop","sourceNumber":6,"corpusSha256":"ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c","hasSourceFigure":true,"historicalChineseUrl":"https://zh.wikisource.org/zh-hans/幾何原本/卷六"}},"revision":{"id":"euclid-6-6@raw-a634fda5da4498d9","contentId":"euclid-6-6","version":1,"status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"a634fda5da4498d9e9a26415af4f9ae18a82eeb151c38e8db27f22db10b788c5","createdBy":"mathforge-corpus-import","changeSummary":"Imported Heath source and machine-assisted Chinese draft. No mathematical or editorial review is implied.","blockIds":["euclid-6-6.statement","euclid-6-6.construction.1","euclid-6-6.proof.1","euclid-6-6.proof.2","euclid-6-6.proof.3","euclid-6-6.proof.4","euclid-6-6.proof.5","euclid-6-6.proof.6","euclid-6-6.proof.7","euclid-6-6.proof.8","euclid-6-6.conclusion","euclid-6-6.historical.1","euclid-6-6.historical.2","euclid-6-6.historical.3","euclid-6-6.source"]},"blocks":[{"id":"euclid-6-6.statement","contentId":"euclid-6-6","revisionId":"euclid-6-6@raw-a634fda5da4498d9","order":0,"kind":"statement","title":"命题陈述","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"e4fb5d3e4acd584832509bc01b7ff4ae1c3575f79fc0a2e71f6d00f1e8b5ab51","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"If two triangles have one angle equal to one angle and the sides about the equal angles proportional, the triangles will be equiangular and will have those angles equal which the corresponding sides subtend."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"如果两个三角形有一个角度等于一个角度,而两边的角等于成比例,则三角形将是等角,其角等于相应两边的角。"},{"id":"historical-zh","role":"historical_source","language":"zh-Hans","status":"source_transcription","text":"两三角形之一角等而等角旁之各两边比例等即两形为等角形而对各相似边之角各等"},{"id":"historical-modern-zh","role":"historical_machine_interpretation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"两个三角形的一个角相等，并且等角两边的比例相等，这意味着这两个形状是等边三角形，并且每条相似边的角相等。"}]},{"id":"euclid-6-6.construction.1","contentId":"euclid-6-6","revisionId":"euclid-6-6@raw-a634fda5da4498d9","order":1,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"8b6b62b608d1fb9ba5f8a8f8b615b03d330ad9e6c7d241fa1f1318d6d1e57e4c","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Let ABC, DEF be two triangles having one angle BAC equal to one angle EDF and the sides about the equal angles proportional, so that, as BA is to AC, so is ED to DF; I say that the triangle ABC is equiangular with the triangle DEF, and will have the angle ABC equal to the angle DEF, and the angle ACB to the angle DFE."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"让ABC,DEF三角形为两个三角形,一个角度BAC,一个角度EDF,两个角度成比例,这样,BA对AC的比等于ED对DF;我说,三角形ABC是同三角形DEF的对角,其角度ABC等于角DEF,而角ACB等于同角DFE；BA 与 AC 之比等于 ED 与 DF 之比。"}]},{"id":"euclid-6-6.proof.1","contentId":"euclid-6-6","revisionId":"euclid-6-6@raw-a634fda5da4498d9","order":2,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"d70039f4163fee013b6b3142c723521d0547c0fe492c1343d0fabf51cc27c46d","citations":["euclid-1-23","euclid-1-32"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For on the straight line DF, and at the points D, F on it, let there be constructed the angle FDG equal to either of the angles BAC, EDF, and the angle DFG equal to the angle ACB; [[I. 23](/principles/euclid-1-23)] therefore the remaining angle at B is equal to the remaining angle at G. [[I. 32](/principles/euclid-1-32)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"直线DF和D、F点,应构造FDG角,等于BAC、EDF角,DFG角,等于ACB角;因此,B点的剩余角等于G点的剩余角。 [[I. 23](/principles/euclid-1-23)] [[I. 32](/principles/euclid-1-32)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-6-6.proof.2","contentId":"euclid-6-6","revisionId":"euclid-6-6@raw-a634fda5da4498d9","order":3,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"a9dde3a134e1e00173aea96c14fad38bc4b0bc218410bb8cc36629921816c673","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore the triangle ABC is equiangular with the triangle DGF."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,三角形ABC是同三角形DGF的等角形。"}]},{"id":"euclid-6-6.proof.3","contentId":"euclid-6-6","revisionId":"euclid-6-6@raw-a634fda5da4498d9","order":4,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 3","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"beab7a4bc5d9cdab20ba39a4b1f84a46302adbbb1959c4eaa8d2b7cc35645080","citations":["euclid-6-4"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore, proportionally, as BA is to AC, so is GD to DF. [[VI. 4](/principles/euclid-6-4)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,BA比AC的比例相当于GD比DF；BA 与 AC 之比等于 GD 与 DF 之比。 [[VI. 4](/principles/euclid-6-4)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-6-6.proof.4","contentId":"euclid-6-6","revisionId":"euclid-6-6@raw-a634fda5da4498d9","order":5,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 4","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"b5204765f3905a5c920907317b74eca0f5916a5f70a3d85a42648cf37fff30e6","citations":["euclid-5-11"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But, by hypothesis, as BA is to AC, so also is ED to DF; therefore also, as ED is to DF, so is GD to DF. [[V. 11](/principles/euclid-5-11)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但是,假设BA比AC,ED比DF,ED比DF,ED比ED比DF,ED比GD比DF；ED 与 DF 之比等于 GD 与 DF 之比。 [[V. 11](/principles/euclid-5-11)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-6-6.proof.5","contentId":"euclid-6-6","revisionId":"euclid-6-6@raw-a634fda5da4498d9","order":6,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 5","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"18841491e83d1ad6eb2f9f0d525d0a74092d0a3e319a8b86c12f37888c6f5c44","citations":["euclid-5-9","euclid-1-4"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore ED is equal to DG; [[V. 9](/principles/euclid-5-9)] and DF is common; therefore the two sides ED, DF are equal to the two sides GD, DF; and the angle EDF is equal to the angle GDF; therefore the base EF is equal to the base GF, and the triangle DEF is equal to the triangle DGF, and the remaining angles will be equal to the remaining angles, namely those which the equal sides subtend. [[I. 4](/principles/euclid-1-4)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,ED等于DG;DF是常见的;因此,双方ED,DF等于双方GD,DF;EDF角等于GDF角;因此,底边,EF等于底边,GF角,三角形DEF等于三角形DGF角,其余角度等于其余角度,即平等方所支持的角度。 [[V. 9](/principles/euclid-5-9)] [[I. 4](/principles/euclid-1-4)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-6-6.proof.6","contentId":"euclid-6-6","revisionId":"euclid-6-6@raw-a634fda5da4498d9","order":7,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 6","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"bde6e520fe7ef4fe0f315224a6843292f084be6dc701751d373039ce7727a6e8","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore the angle DFG is equal to the angle DFE, and the angle DGF to the angle DEF."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,DFG角等于DFE角,DGF角等于DEF角。"}]},{"id":"euclid-6-6.proof.7","contentId":"euclid-6-6","revisionId":"euclid-6-6@raw-a634fda5da4498d9","order":8,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 7","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"5b15f4448ac1c57d6fce82542b1e5dcefecb61fda91b67d3a7dabcfbd19598d3","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But the angle DFG is equal to the angle ACB; therefore the angle ACB is also equal to the angle DFE."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但DFG角等于ACB角,因此ACB角也等于DFE角。"}]},{"id":"euclid-6-6.proof.8","contentId":"euclid-6-6","revisionId":"euclid-6-6@raw-a634fda5da4498d9","order":9,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 8","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"c711338ee894963925af60d08f1948437274d81db72c55b217a72f023f1d7b8d","citations":["euclid-1-32"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And, by hypothesis, the angle BAC is also equal to the angle EDF; therefore the remaining angle at B is also equal to the remaining angle at E; [[I. 32](/principles/euclid-1-32)] therefore the triangle ABC is equiangular with the triangle DEF."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"假设说,BAC角也等于EDF角;因此,B的剩余角也等于E的剩余角;因此,三角形ABC是三角形DEF的等角。 [[I. 32](/principles/euclid-1-32)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-6-6.conclusion","contentId":"euclid-6-6","revisionId":"euclid-6-6@raw-a634fda5da4498d9","order":10,"kind":"conclusion","title":"结论","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"d41f4fe56dd428c759377c807a93013dffbbe29c7596acfdac57dd182cad51b6","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore etc. Q. E. D."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,等等,证毕。"}]},{"id":"euclid-6-6.historical.1","contentId":"euclid-6-6","revisionId":"euclid-6-6@raw-a634fda5da4498d9","order":11,"kind":"historical_note","title":"徐光启、利玛窦历史中译 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"134b8f00cbe6c82cc120ab4864e9cb0eeb593a88bdf0d2d4f23e58b75e7256cd","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"historical-zh","role":"historical_source","language":"zh-Hans","status":"source_transcription","text":"两三角形之一角等而等角旁之各两边比例等即两形为等角形而对各相似边之角各等"},{"id":"historical-modern-zh","role":"historical_machine_interpretation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"两个三角形的一个角相等，并且等角两边的比例相等，这意味着这两个形状是等边三角形，并且每条相似边的角相等。"}]},{"id":"euclid-6-6.historical.2","contentId":"euclid-6-6","revisionId":"euclid-6-6@raw-a634fda5da4498d9","order":12,"kind":"historical_note","title":"徐光启、利玛窦历史中译 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"0a3321ec10a434fc4ecf9c416238cec85ed7dbafb150ca5963f77facf8e6947f","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"historical-zh","role":"historical_source","language":"zh-Hans","status":"source_transcription","text":"解曰：甲乙丙丁戊己两角形其乙与戊两角等而甲乙与乙丙之比例若丁戊与戊己题言馀角丙与己甲与丁俱等"},{"id":"historical-modern-zh","role":"historical_machine_interpretation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"解释如下：甲乙丙丁戊己，两个三角形具有 乙 和 戊 相等的角，同时 甲乙 与 乙丙 的比值是 丁戊 与 戊己 的比值。命题解释：丙、己甲 和 丁 的其余部分都相等。"}]},{"id":"euclid-6-6.historical.3","contentId":"euclid-6-6","revisionId":"euclid-6-6@raw-a634fda5da4498d9","order":13,"kind":"historical_note","title":"徐光启、利玛窦历史中译 3","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"030fdefd5102581c94bcb9776260626f765b7f26140165e20ef813771e759b38","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"historical-zh","role":"historical_source","language":"zh-Hans","status":"source_transcription","text":"论曰：试作己戊庚角与乙角等作庚己戊角与丙角等而戊庚己庚两线遇于庚依前论推显甲乙丙庚戊己两形等角即甲乙与乙丙之比例若庚戊与戊己也〈本篇四〉甲乙与乙丙元若丁戊与戊己则庚戊与戊己亦若丁戊与戊己也〈五卷十一〉而丁戊与庚戊两线必等〈五卷九〉夫丁戊庚戊两边既等戊己同边庚戊己角与丁戊己角又等〈丁戊己角与乙角等而己戊庚亦与〉〈乙等故〉即其馀各相当之角俱等〈一卷四〉而庚角既与甲角等庚己戊角既与丙角等即甲角丙角与丁角戊己丁角各等而甲乙丙丁戊己为等角形矣"},{"id":"historical-modern-zh","role":"historical_machine_interpretation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"证明如下：试验使 己戊庚 和 乙 成角，庚己戊 和 丙 相等。两条直线 戊庚己庚 在 庚 相交。根据前面的讨论，这两种形状的角度 甲乙丙庚戊己 相等，即 甲乙 与 乙丙 的比值相等。如果 庚戊 和 戊己 是 〈本篇四〉甲乙 和 乙丙，如果 丁戊 是 戊己，则 庚戊 和 戊己 相等。如果 丁戊 和 戊己 也是 〈五卷十一〉，两条直线 丁戊 和 庚戊 必须相等，〈五卷九〉 和 丁戊庚戊，两边相等，戊己 在同一边，庚戊己 和 丁戊己 也相等 〈丁戊己角与乙角等而己戊庚亦与〉〈乙等故〉 意味着其他等价角都相等。〈一卷四〉 和 庚 等于 甲，庚己戊 等于 丙，因此 甲、丙 和 丁 都相等，甲乙丙丁戊己 是一个等边三角形。"}]},{"id":"euclid-6-6.source","contentId":"euclid-6-6","revisionId":"euclid-6-6@raw-a634fda5da4498d9","order":14,"kind":"source","title":"来源、译者与开放许可","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"ec82e66e859ad622aa0270766eb7850022bf176c2beb42fc14db31275ff34a67","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"provenance","role":"provenance_note","language":"en","status":"generated_metadata","text":"Perseus / Heath source: https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:6.prop.6/\nCorpus URN: urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:6.prop.6\nCorpus SHA-256: ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c\nLicense: CC BY-SA 4.0 (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/)\nHistorical Chinese source: https://zh.wikisource.org/zh-hans/幾何原本/卷六"}]}],"outgoingEdges":[{"id":"edge:euclid-6-6:euclid-1-23:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-6-6","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-6-6.proof.1"],"targetContentId":"euclid-1-23","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:6.prop.6","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:6.prop.6/","sourceLabel":"I. 23"}},{"id":"edge:euclid-6-6:euclid-1-32:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-6-6","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-6-6.proof.1","euclid-6-6.proof.8"],"targetContentId":"euclid-1-32","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:6.prop.6","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.pe